5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! Trip time! I want us to go somewhere super fun, but we should make sure the money part is easy and fair for everyone so nobody gets sad later. What do you guys think?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree, Sakura. To avoid any misunderstandings, I think it's important that we have a clear, comprehensive view of the total costs before we make a final decision. We should look into the all-in rates.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with you both. While costs are important, I also think we should consider how the layout of where we stay affects our time together. I want us all to feel comfortable and happy.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree that costs and comfort are key. However, we should also consider the logistics of the journey. I want to ensure we don't spend too much of our limited time just moving between places.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I think it would be good to know about the room arrangements and the bathrooms too. Just to make sure everyone is comfortable while we're there.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, all-in rates sound like a great idea! That way we don't have to keep track of tiny things. Maybe we should also check how much rooms costed last time to compare?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Comparing with last year's costs could provide a useful benchmark, Sakura. However, I'm more concerned with the current total. I'd also like to know the pricing of offshore houses let whole to see if that's more predictable.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"That sounds like a good plan, Victoria. Since we're talking about the house, maybe we should also look at how our days actually ran last year? It might help us find a better balance this time.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, looking at last year's schedule is a good idea. I'm particularly interested in the ferry sailings and train times to see how much of our trip is spent in transit.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it's important. Maybe we could also check the bathing hours and bathroom provision? I just want to make sure we don't have any problems with the facilities.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, you're so thoughtful! I'll help look into the money stuff so we can just focus on the fun parts. I think knowing the all-in rates and the separate room costs would be super helpful!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, thank you. I believe having a fixed total is the most rational approach. I will focus on the all-in rates and the pricing of offshore houses let whole to ensure we have a clear budget.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll look into how last year's days ran and the time alone in the shared-house year. I want to make sure we find a balance that makes everyone feel included and relaxed.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into the ferry sailings and train times, as well as getting around by train and bus. I want to see exactly how much time we will spend in transit.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll... I'll look into the bathing hours and bathroom provision, and also the inn mealtimes and room arrangements. I just want to make sure the living space works for everyone.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Everything is decided! I'll check the all-in rates against meals bought separately and what separately booked rooms cost last time. Let's find the fairest way to pay so we can have the best trip ever!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,It seems we have a comprehensive plan. I will proceed with researching the all-in rates and the pricing of offshore houses let whole. I look forward to seeing the results so we can make an informed decision.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we're all on the same page. I'll focus on our past experiences to help us create a wonderful atmosphere this year. I can't wait to see what everyone finds out!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will stick to my plan. I'll investigate the ferry sailings and train times, along with the local transport options. Let's see if we can find a destination that maximizes our actual vacation time.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Okay... I'll look into the bathing hours and bathroom provision, and the inn mealtimes and room arrangements. I hope the information helps us find a place where everyone can relax.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
